# The node store is a set of nodes keyed by id, not a list of lines: ULIDs put
# every newly created node at the tail of the file, so two branches that each
# add nodes collide on adjacent lines over a difference that is not one.
# The driver merges by node id instead. It is registered per clone — see the
# `kb-jsonl` block in tools/kb/AGENTS.md.
.kb/nodes.jsonl merge=kb-jsonl
tools/kb/.kb/nodes.jsonl merge=kb-jsonl
